          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عصابة (ʿiṣāba) is built on the native Arabic root ʿ-ṣ-b (Lane), \"to bind round\". Lane gives ʿiṣāba as a band tied round the head, and as a band of men bound together."
